# Security + caching headers — Cloudflare Pages (single source of truth).
# The CSP governing scripts/styles/images/fonts/frames/forms is generated at
# BUILD TIME by Astro (security.csp in astro.config.ts) as a per-page <meta>
# with SHA-256 hashes, so no 'unsafe-inline'. frame-ancestors is ignored in a
# <meta> CSP, so the anti-clickjacking policy is set here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/og/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
